{"id":"n51771-1-7","stage":1,"title":"마리 · 只","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51771-1-7-1","ko":"너희 집에서는 개를 몇 마리 기르니?","zh":"你们家养了几只狗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们。","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"2","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서는","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서는","audio":"/audio/79091f71ee09fc478ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"개를","meaning":"狗，犬","explanation":"개：狗，犬；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64115","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개를","audio":"/audio/b9e30b37fd98095ca25e.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"마리","meaning":"只，头，条","explanation":"마리：只，头，条。","readings":[{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51771","senseId":"1","lemma":"마리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마리","audio":"/audio/1338676ef4cf144fb5fa.mp3"}},{"text":"기르니?","meaning":"养，喂养，饲养，栽培","explanation":"기르다：养，喂养，饲养，栽培；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"1","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"s